{"id":489,"name":"Clannad Movie","slug":"clannad_movie","synopsis":"Clannad is set in a high-school located in some Japanese town. Okazaki Tomoya is a third-year student who doesn't take his studies seriously. Always late for class, he's seen as a delinquent by the rest of his classmates who are busy preparing for their entrance examinations. Needless to say, he hasn't too many close friends either.\n\nTomoya seems not to mind too - until one day he meets a girl, Furukawa Nagisa, who is left alone without friends on this school, because everybody she knew already graduated. What a clumsy girl, he thinks at first. But he can't leave her alone and so, while helping her, he meets a few other girls from his school. Although he doesn't care much about them at first, he soon opens his heart to them as they get to know each other better.\n\n(Source: AniDB)","format":"MOVIE","season":"SUMMER","year":2007,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:43:37","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 01:06:54","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":1723},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":1723},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":1544},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":4402},{"site":"ANN","externalId":6436},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":1777}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":975,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/pr9mwdUJAbZcQRSBGHuR3y5KAtGM5Uj2yBYx0Vzm.png"},{"id":976,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/jXKlKlJpa5aYISQxYu3LWFfRE0BjFSnVpuRFAr8L.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":38,"name":"Toei Animation","slug":"toei_animation"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":25,"name":"Clannad","slug":"clannad"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":2696,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":2696,"title":"Megumeru","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":3025,"version":1,"episodes":null,"nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":1915,"basename":"ClannadMovie-OP1.webm","filename":"ClannadMovie-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/ClannadMovie-OP1.webm","mimetype":"video/webm","size":52278695,"